{{Quote|You should have let them carry you on a litter."''<br />''"I'm not being carried around the streets like a useless noble.|[[Fennec Shand]] and [[Boba Fett]]|<ref name="Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land">{{BOBF|Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land}}</ref>}}
[[File:The-Twins-Hutts-Boba-Espa.png|thumb|right|250px|[[The Twins]] being carried on a litter.]]
A '''litter''' was a platform on which individuals of importance were often carried by servants. On [[Tatooine]] the reigning [[Hutt]] [[crime lord]]s were often carried on litters as a sign of their rule.<ref name="Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land" />
